ss="ff5">Robisz wbrew <span class="ff9">mnie</span>.</span> <span class="ff6">Dzięki<span class="ff5"> <span class="ff9">tobie</span> </span>żyję! Jestem <span class="ff5">przeciw <span class="ff9">niemu</span>!</span></span><span class="lsa">),</span> </div><div class="t m0 x41 h10 y4d5 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _a"> </span></span>na zaimku jest <span class="ff4">akcent emocjonalny</span> (<span class="ff5">Daj to tylko <span class="ff9">mnie<span class="ff6">. Dziękuję </span>tobie</span>, a nie jej!</span> </div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha yc14 ff4 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">C. Forma po przyimku<span class="ff2"> jest specyficzna (przedrostek </span>n-<span class="ff3">) dla zaimków 3<span class="ff2">-ej osoby:  </span></span></div><div class="t m0 xa1 ha ycb6 ff9 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">     on<span class="ff2"> <span class="ls5">i </span></span>ono<span class="ff5"> (wbrew </span>n<span class="ff5">iemu), </span>ona<span class="ff5"> (przeciw </span>n<span class="ff5">iej)</span>;<span class="ff5"> </span>oni<span class="ff2"> <span class="ls5">i </span></span>one<span class="ff5"> <span class="ff6">(na przekór </span></span>n<span class="ff5">im). </span></div><div class="t m0 x7 h7 ycb7 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0"> </div><div class="t m0 x7 ha ycb8 ff7 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">15. Proszę wybrać poprawn<span class="ff4">y wariant (zaimki osobowe). </span></div></div><div class="c x7 ycb9 w5 h143"><div class="t m0 x1c ha ycba ff3 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">WZÓR: <span class="ff5">Ufam <span class="ff9 ls6">ci<span class="ls0"> <span class="ls5">/ ty</span> <span class="ls5">/ </span>tobie</span></span>!<span class="ff2"> </span></span></div><div class="t m0 x16 h10 y2e5 ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="ffa"> <span class="_ _17"> </span><span class="ff3">Chcę ofiarować to <span class="ff4">ona <span class="ls5">/ </span>niej <span class="ls5">/ </span>jej</span></span></span>. </div><div class="t m0 x16 h10 ycbb ff2 fs3 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span 